{"summary":"The nerdiest adventure of your life!","description":"Four nerds, drawn into a fantasy world and mistaken for heroes, have to battle their way through a massive, crazy adventure and defeat a preposterous villain!\n\nThis great offline, old school RPG has magic, dungeons, pizza, great story and funny jokes galore. If you ever enjoyed 8bit and 16bit role playing game, pen and paper rpg and nerd humor, you are going to love this great addictive rpg!\n\nDo&De features NO in-app purchases (IAP) or ads - you get the entire game for one price! Something that's incredible in 2022!\n\n* 20 hours of story and 20 hours of extras, adventures, side-quests, and more!\n* Turn-based, easy-to-learn combat\n* Change your party order to apply special bonuses\n* 100 levels of experience\n* More than 200 special powers and spells\n* More than 300 enemies\n* More than 500 items between potions, chips, weapons, shirts, and armor\n* More than 700 locations,\n* More than 10,000 lines of dialog\n* Epic Flying Spaghetti Monster!\n\nSee what the users are saying on our official Facebook page: \nhttps://www.facebook.com/DoomAndDestiny","esrbNotes":"Strong Language","pegiNotes":"Strong Language","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Av9EpueKgVU?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7EKaoqSPMXZqnLyUZvmN8DQuJm2q-bPwnBMn6C1BFGSsgf9Ewj5_pe_OvB3A40PVQ6sKoxMkm6OJwS5UzSOong","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kCue1W_7QYW_b0YaM_kh8cY8rWNRBIzurOFJMLpatBa4b30Z5hQRPXJOYxLR19vmxWKjazMnoBcCxmC3GNLo","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0TiwQ7xQo4Folw8Sew4qbYxB3ZyrKgXU6QUih-AHldAe2ZtVC8GO84Fj9wQHM0mnSK0_4DLazjVy_Jdx08je3w","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jDli01wtuXGNQSD_fFCCT4LGOMBXwslCVvmmN4bJi-tzC7tjWg5SJWJpiJLU9hCF_jZxJRLQ6_vsj0qyjYcklQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/26dxFjOglxy_WkII7HJ9b4Ul7vkL1TfF0oAC3acTMjoKwQSgqcN8oqVggXrO4QBYhjVHUSLbS_P8qIaOSoc-","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/r_tu